 Self-realization) by selfless service (Karma-yoga) alone. You should also perform your duty with a view to guide people, and for universal welfare of the society.","key":true,"vs":[12,44],"say":"And leaders carry a special duty, because others copy them. Verse twenty. King Janaka and others attained perfection (or Self-realization) by selfless service (Karma-yoga) alone. You should also perform your duty with a view to guide people, and for universal welfare of the society.","start":120.84,"at":121.416,"end":142.104,"words":[[0.138,0.15,"And"],[0.3,0.463,"leaders"],[0.775,0.338,"carry"],[1.125,0.062,"a"],[1.2,0.412,"special"],[1.625,0.487,"duty"],[2.388,0.312,"because"],[2.712,0.362,"others"],[3.087,0.312,"copy"],[3.413,0.3,"them"],[4.075,0.425,"Verse"],[4.513,0.625,"twenty"],[5.5,0.3,"King"],[5.812,0.588,"Janaka"],[6.412,0.2,"and"],[6.625,0.325,"others"],[6.963,0.375,"attained"],[7.35,0.65,"perfection"],[8.213,0.125,"or"],[8.35,1.087,"Self-realization"],[9.713,0.138,"by"],[9.863,0.512,"selfless"],[10.387,0.537,"service"],[11.137,0.75,"Karma-yoga"],[12.062,0.475,"alone"],[12.938,0.113,"You"],[13.062,0.188,"should"],[13.262,0.338,"also"],[13.613,0.4,"perform"],[14.025,0.113,"your"],[14.15,0.5,"duty"],[14.662,0.175,"with"],[14.85,0.05,"a"],[14.912,0.287,"view"],[15.213,0.113,"to"],[15.338,0.312,"guide"],[15.662,0.438,"people"],[16.425,0.125,"and"],[16.562,0.125,"for"],[16.7,0.675,"universal"],[17.387,0.463,"welfare"],[17.863,0.15,"of"],[18.025,0.087,"the"],[18.125,0.75,"society"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L5"],"ref":"3.22","verse":"O Arjuna, there is nothing in the three worlds (heaven, earth, and the lower regions) that should be done by Me, nor there is anything that I should obtain, yet I engage in action.","key":false,"vs":[7,41],"say":"Then Krishna points to himself. Verse twenty-two. O Arjuna, there is nothing in the three worlds (heaven, earth, and the lower regions) that should be done by Me, nor there is anything that I should obtain, yet I engage in action. If he ever stopped, he says, people everywhere would follow his example, and the world would fall into confusion.","start":142.104,"at":142.68,"end":165.504,"words":[[0.138,0.287,"Then"],[0.438,0.463,"Krishna"],[0.912,0.375,"points"],[1.3,0.113,"to"],[1.425,0.713,"himself"],[2.5,0.425,"Verse"],[2.938,0.875,"twenty-two"],[4.2,0.175,"O"],[4.388,0.575,"Arjuna"],[5.2,0.1,"there"],[5.312,0.138,"is"],[5.463,0.325,"nothing"],[5.8,0.075,"in"],[5.888,0.087,"the"],[5.987,0.275,"three"],[6.275,0.512,"worlds"],[7.013,0.388,"heaven"],[7.588,0.338,"earth"],[8.113,0.087,"and"],[8.213,0.087,"the"],[8.312,0.287,"lower"],[8.613,0.562,"regions"],[9.4,0.125,"that"],[9.537,0.188,"should"],[9.738,0.1,"be"],[9.85,0.212,"done"],[10.075,0.15,"by"],[10.238,0.263,"Me"],[10.787,0.163,"nor"],[10.963,0.113,"there"],[11.088,0.15,"is"],[11.25,0.388,"anything"],[11.65,0.125,"that"],[11.787,0.075,"I"],[11.875,0.175,"should"],[12.062,0.487,"obtain"],[12.85,0.175,"yet"],[13.037,0.1,"I"],[13.15,0.425,"engage"],[13.588,0.1,"in"],[13.7,0.512,"action"],[14.613,0.138,"If"],[14.762,0.15,"he"],[14.925,0.2,"ever"],[15.137,0.5,"stopped"],[15.85,0.113,"he"],[15.975,0.45,"says"],[16.7,0.35,"people"],[17.062,0.412,"everywhere"],[17.488,0.175,"would"],[17.675,0.312,"follow"],[18.0,0.163,"his"],[18.175,0.562,"example"],[19.025,0.075,"and"],[19.113,0.087,"the"],[19.212,0.4,"world"],[19.625,0.15,"would"],[19.788,0.275,"fall"],[20.075,0.225,"into"],[20.312,0.7,"confusion"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L6"],"ref":"3.27","verse":"All work is done by the energy and power of nature, but due to delusion of ignorance, people assume themselves to be the doer and thus incur sin or Karmic bondage.","key":true,"vs":[9,40],"say":"Who is actually doing all this work? Verse twenty-seven. All work is done by the energy and power of nature, but due to delusion of ignorance, people assume themselves to be the doer and thus incur sin or Karmic bondage.","start":165.504,"at":166.08,"end":181.488,"words":[[0.125,0.188,"Who"],[0.325,0.15,"is"],[0.487,0.487,"actually"],[0.988,0.338,"doing"],[1.337,0.138,"all"],[1.488,0.212,"this"],[1.712,0.55,"work"],[2.65,0.362,"Verse"],[3.025,0.9,"twenty-seven"],[4.325,0.225,"All"],[4.562,0.312,"work"],[4.888,0.113,"is"],[5.013,0.25,"done"],[5.275,0.138,"by"],[5.425,0.163,"the"],[5.6,0.4,"energy"],[6.013,0.125,"and"],[6.15,0.362,"power"],[6.525,0.113,"of"],[6.65,0.463,"nature"],[7.412,0.175,"but"],[7.6,0.2,"due"],[7.812,0.1,"to"],[7.925,0.475,"delusion"],[8.412,0.087,"of"],[8.512,0.537,"ignorance"],[9.3,0.287,"people"],[9.6,0.35,"assume"],[9.963,0.487,"themselves"],[10.463,0.1,"to"],[10.575,0.138,"be"],[10.725,0.125,"the"],[10.863,0.325,"doer"],[11.2,0.175,"and"],[11.387,0.237,"thus"],[11.637,0.325,"incur"],[11.975,0.45,"sin"],[12.438,0.113,"or"],[12.562,0.425,"Karmic"],[13.0,0.588,"bondage"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L11"],"ref":"3.37","verse":"The Supreme Lord said: It is lust (or intense desire for material and sensual pleasures), born out of passion, that becomes anger when unfulfilled. Lust is insatiable and is a great devil. Know this as the enemy.","key":true,"vs":[27,64],"say":"Arjuna then asks: what drives a person to do wrong, even against their own will, as if pushed by force? Krishna answers in one word. Verse thirty-seven. The Supreme Lord said: It is lust (or intense desire for material and sensual pleasures), born out of passion, that becomes anger when unfulfilled. Lust is insatiable and is a great devil. Know this as the enemy.","start":181.488,"at":182.064,"end":208.44,"words":[[0.138,0.5,"Arjuna"],[0.65,0.2,"then"],[0.863,0.5,"asks"],[1.675,0.225,"what"],[1.913,0.338,"drives"],[2.263,0.062,"a"],[2.337,0.425,"person"],[2.775,0.087,"to"],[2.875,0.163,"do"],[3.05,0.375,"wrong"],[3.65,0.2,"even"],[3.862,0.35,"against"],[4.225,0.113,"their"],[4.35,0.225,"own"],[4.588,0.338,"will"],[5.125,0.087,"as"],[5.225,0.138,"if"],[5.375,0.312,"pushed"],[5.7,0.15,"by"],[5.862,0.588,"force"],[6.825,0.45,"Krishna"],[7.287,0.537,"answers"],[7.838,0.163,"in"],[8.012,0.25,"one"],[8.275,0.5,"word"],[9.15,0.412,"Verse"],[9.575,0.887,"thirty-seven"],[10.863,0.113,"The"],[10.988,0.463,"Supreme"],[11.463,0.263,"Lord"],[11.738,0.338,"said"],[12.35,0.087,"It"],[12.45,0.15,"is"],[12.613,0.487,"lust"],[13.287,0.113,"or"],[13.412,0.438,"intense"],[13.863,0.5,"desire"],[14.375,0.125,"for"],[14.512,0.6,"material"],[15.125,0.1,"and"],[15.238,0.463,"sensual"],[15.713,0.525,"pleasures"],[16.5,0.237,"born"],[16.75,0.175,"out"],[16.938,0.1,"of"],[17.05,0.475,"passion"],[17.788,0.125,"that"],[17.925,0.388,"becomes"],[18.325,0.375,"anger"],[18.712,0.175,"when"],[18.9,0.8,"unfulfilled"],[20.075,0.4,"Lust"],[20.488,0.113,"is"],[20.613,0.85,"insatiable"],[21.475,0.138,"and"],[21.625,0.113,"is"],[21.75,0.075,"a"],[21.837,0.375,"great"],[22.225,0.463,"devil"],[23.087,0.263,"Know"],[23.363,0.35,"this"],[23.725,0.175,"as"],[23.913,0.163,"the"],[24.087,0.475,"enemy"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":[],"ref":"3.38","verse":"As the fire is covered by smoke, as a mirror by dust, and as an embryo by the amnion, similarly Self-knowledge becomes obscured by lust.","key":true,"vs":[8,33],"say":"He paints it in three pictures. Verse thirty-eight. As the fire is covered by smoke, as a mirror by dust, and as an embryo by the amnion, similarly Self-knowledge becomes obscured by lust.","start":208.44,"at":209.016,"end":223.176,"words":[[0.125,0.125,"He"],[0.263,0.4,"paints"],[0.675,0.175,"it"],[0.863,0.15,"in"],[1.025,0.25,"three"],[1.288,0.7,"pictures"],[2.35,0.438,"Verse"],[2.8,0.838,"thirty-eight"],[4.037,0.163,"As"],[4.213,0.1,"the"],[4.325,0.412,"fire"],[4.75,0.15,"is"],[4.912,0.325,"covered"],[5.25,0.15,"by"],[5.412,0.512,"smoke"],[6.1,0.113,"as"],[6.225,0.05,"a"],[6.287,0.35,"mirror"],[6.65,0.138,"by"],[6.8,0.525,"dust"],[7.588,0.113,"and"],[7.713,0.125,"as"],[7.85,0.1,"an"],[7.963,0.438,"embryo"],[8.412,0.163,"by"],[8.588,0.138,"the"],[8.738,0.463,"amnion"],[9.5,0.5,